47
00:03:01,340 --> 00:03:04,560
It has the view of all devices,

48
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:06,240
and interrupts, and memory,

49
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:09,670
and page tables and so forth.

50
00:03:09,670 --> 00:03:13,600
A virtual machine
operating system known as

51
00:03:13,600 --> 00:03:17,840
